12790583,2025-04-01,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I am filing a complaint regarding identity theft that has resulted in unauthorized accounts and credit inquiries appearing on my credit report. These actions violate my rights under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), specifically Sections 609, 604, 611, and 605A.

