12823654,2025-04-04,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"To Whom It May Concern, I am filing this formal complaint with the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) regarding repeated violations of my rights under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) by all three major credit bureaus ( Equifax, Experian, and TransUnion ) and several creditor companies.

