12839103,2025-04-05,Debt collection,Other debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive enough information to verify debt,"On XX/XX/year>, I submitted a formal written dispute to Jefferson Capital Systems , LLC regarding an alleged charged-off Upstart debt ( original creditor : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, Account # : XXXX, XXXX Ref XXXX : XXXX ). In response, Jefferson Capital issued a boilerplate validation letter that failed to comply with the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) and the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) in both substance and sufficiency.

