12959276,2025-04-12,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Investigation took more than 30 days,"I am writing to file a formal complaint against [ Credit Bureau Name ] for its failure to remove fraudulent accounts from my credit report as required by law.

