15 U.S.C. 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ) Verification Requirement : Federal law mandates that any account reported must be verified through physical inspection of the original signed consumer contract. Without such verification, inaccurate or fraudulent information may remain in my file. I am formally requesting the immediate removal of this unauthorized information.

15 U.S.C. 1681e ( b ) Accuracy Compliance : You are legally required to follow reasonable procedures to ensure the maximum possible accuracy of the information in my credit file. If any information can not be verified, it must be deleted pursuant to 1681i ( a ) ( 5 ).

