15 U.S.C. 1681e ( b ) : The bureau has failed to demonstrate that reasonable procedures were followed to ensure the accuracy and completeness of the information in my credit file. I am requesting a detailed explanation of the methods used. 

Requested Resolution I respectfully request that the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) investigate this matter and take immediate action to ensure the fraudulent account is permanently deleted from my credit report. 

