13080669,2025-04-21,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"This correspondence serves as a formal follow-up and final notice regarding your continued noncompliance with the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), despite my previous dispute dated XX/XX/XXXX. To date, you have failed to conduct a proper reinvestigation of the disputed account listed below, nor have you provided the legally required verification documentation in response to my demand under FCRA 611 ( a ).

