I reserve all rights to pursue monetary damages, including : Statutory damages up to {$1000.00} per violation ; Punitive damages for willful noncompliance ; Compensation for actual damages, including emotional distress and credit denials ; Legal fees and court costs, if litigation becomes necessary. 
